## 2. Setup Instructions

### 2.1 Prerequisites

- **Rust** (MSVC toolchain): <https://rustup.rs> — `x86_64-pc-windows-msvc`.
- **MSVC Build Tools + Windows SDK** (linker & resource compiler). rustup
  offers to install Visual Studio Build Tools; otherwise:
  `winget install Microsoft.VisualStudio.2022.BuildTools`.
- **Node.js ≥ 18** (npm).
- Optional, for the Android tab: **Android SDK platform-tools + emulator**
  (Android Studio → SDK Manager). Set `ANDROID_HOME`, or leave it in
  `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Android\Sdk`.

### 2.2 Install and run

```powershell
# from the project root
npm install            # frontend dependencies
npm run tauri dev      # dev build + hot-reload window
```

The first `dev` run compiles the Rust backend (~5–10 min once).

### 2.3 Verify without the GUI (optional)

```powershell
cd src-tauri
cargo check            # type-checks the whole Rust backend
cd ..
npm run build          # type-checks TS + produces dist/
```

